{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12689","headline":"喻常吾直 · 元结","name":"喻常吾直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山泽多饥人，闾里多坏屋。\n战争且未息，徴敛何时足。\n不能救人患，不合食天粟。\n何况假一官，而苟求其禄。\n近年更长吏，数月未爲速。\n来者罢而官，岂得不爲辱。\n劝爲辞府主，从我游退谷。\n谷中有寒泉，爲尔洗尘服。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}